  "question": {
    "text": "A wire of length <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>20</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math> is to be cut into two pieces. A piece of length <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>&#8467;</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;is bent to make a square of area <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;and the other piece of length <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>&#8467;</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;is made into a circle of area <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math>. If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;is minimum then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#960;</mi><msub><mi>&#8467;</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mo>:</mo><msub><mi>&#8467;</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;is equal to:",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "quRrc",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>6</mn><mo>:</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>1</mn></math>",
